<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-Hant">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>瘜券?萇?恕嚚策?潮雿輻??瘜券???仿?</title>
<meta name="description" content="?潮撠瘜券??日雿??嗚??萇?喟?瘜券摮貊?蝬脤?">
<link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 100 100'%3E%3Crect width='100' height='100' rx='22' fill='%234f56e8'/%3E%3Ctext x='50' y='72' font-size='58' text-anchor='middle' fill='white' font-family='sans-serif'%3E%E3%84%85%3C/text%3E%3C/svg%3E">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans+TC:wght@400;500;700;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
/* ========== 閮剛?霈 ========== */
:root{
  --bg:#f5f3ee; --panel:#ffffff; --panel2:#edebe4;
  --ink:#26282f; --mut:#8b8fa0; --line:#e6e3da;
  --ci:#2f6df6;  /* ?脫? ??*/
  --cm:#8b5cf6;  /* 隞 蝝?*/
  --cf:#0ea373;  /* ?餅? 蝬?*/
  --ct:#e08a00;  /* ?脰矽 璈?*/
  --acc:#4f56e8;
  --kw:58px; --kh:56px;
}
*{box-sizing:border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent}
html,body{margin:0; padding:0}
body{
  background:var(--bg); color:var(--ink);
  font-family:'Noto Sans TC','Microsoft JhengHei','PingFang TC',system-ui,sans-serif;
  line-height:1.55;
}
main{width:min(1080px,96vw); margin:0 auto 60px}

/* ========== ?? ========== */
header{
  width:min(1080px,96vw); margin:22px auto 10px;
  display:flex; align-items:center; gap:14px; flex-wrap:wrap;
}
.logo{
  width:54px; height:54px; border-radius:14px; flex:none;
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,#4f56e8,#7aa5ff);
  color:#fff; font-size:22px; font-weight:900;
  display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
  box-shadow:0 6px 16px rgba(79,86,232,.28);
}
header h1{font-size:22px; margin:0; letter-spacing:1px}
header .sub{font-size:13px; color:var(--mut); margin-top:2px}
.hcontrols{margin-left:auto; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; flex-wrap:wrap}
.hcontrols select{
  max-width:220px; padding:7px 10px; border:1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius:10px; background:#fff; font-family:inherit; font-size:13px; color:var(--ink);
}
.iconbtn{
  border:1px solid var(--line); background:#fff; border-radius:10px;
  padding:7px 12px; font-size:14px; cursor:pointer; font-family:inherit;
}
.iconbtn:hover{border-color:#c9c6bb}
#voiceWarn{display:none; font-size:12px; color:#b45309; background:#fef3c7; border:1px solid #fde68a; border-radius:8px; padding:4px 8px}

/* ========== ?? ========== */
.tabs{
  width:min(1080px,96vw); margin:8px auto 18px;
  display:flex; gap:6px; background:var(--panel2); padding:6px; border-radius:14px;
}
.tabs button{
  flex:1; border:none; background:transparent; padding:10px 6px;
  font-family:inherit; font-size:15px; font-weight:700; color:#6d7180;
  border-radius:10px; cursor:pointer; transition:all .15s;
}
.tabs button.on{background:#fff; color:var(--acc); box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.08)}

.panel{background:var(--panel); border-radius:18px; padding:22px; box-shadow:0 2px 14px rgba(40,40,60,.06); margin-bottom:18px}
section[id^="tab-"]{display:none}
section.show{display:block}

h2{font-size:18px; margin:0 0 6px}
.desc{font-size:13.5px; color:var(--mut); margin:0 0 14px}
kbd{
  display:inline-block; min-width:20px; text-align:center;
  border:1px solid #d5d2c8; border-bottom-width:2px; border-radius:5px;
  background:#faf9f6; padding:1px 5px; font-size:11.5px;
  font-family:Consolas,ui-monospace,monospace; color:#555;
}

/* ========== ??萇 ========== */
.kbwrap{overflow-x:auto; padding-bottom:4px}
.keyboard{width:max-content; margin:0 auto; padding:14px; background:var(--panel2); border-radius:16px}
.krow{display:flex; gap:6px; margin-bottom:6px}
.krow.r1{margin-left:calc(var(--kw)*.35)}
.krow.r2{margin-left:calc(var(--kw)*.62)}
.krow.r3{margin-left:calc(var(--kw)*1.05)}
.krow.rs{justify-content:center; margin-bottom:0}
.key{
  width:var(--kw); height:var(--kh); border-radius:10px; position:relative;
  background:#fff; box-shadow:0 2px 0 #d8d5cc;
  display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
  cursor:pointer; user-select:none; transition:transform .05s, background .15s;
  border-top:3px solid #d8d5cc;
}
.key:active,.key.active{transform:translateY(2px); box-shadow:0 0 0 #d8d5cc}
.key .kq{position:absolute; top:3px; left:6px; font-size:10px; color:#b6b3aa; font-family:Consolas,monospace}
.key .kz{font-size:21px; font-weight:700; line-height:1.1}
.key .kp{font-size:10px; line-height:1; margin-top:1px}
.key.cat-i{border-top-color:var(--ci)} .key.cat-i .kp{color:var(--ci)}
.key.cat-m{border-top-color:var(--cm)} .key.cat-m .kp{color:var(--cm)}
.key.cat-f{border-top-color:var(--cf)} .key.cat-f .kp{color:var(--cf)}
.key.cat-t{border-top-color:var(--ct)} .key.cat-t .kp{color:var(--ct)}
.key.ghost{opacity:.28; pointer-events:none}
.key.space{width:calc(var(--kw)*6.2)}
.key.space .kz{font-size:13.5px; font-weight:500; color:#8a6d1f}
.key.good{background:#d1fae5}
.key.bad{background:#fee2e2; animation:shake .3s}
.key.hintkey{outline:3px solid var(--acc); animation:pulse 1s infinite}
.keyboard.blind .key:not(.space) .kz,
.keyboard.blind .key:not(.space) .kp{opacity:0}
.keyboard.blind .key.hintkey .kz,
.keyboard.blind .key.hintkey .kp,
.keyboard.blind .key.good .kz,
.keyboard.blind .key.good .kp{opacity:1}
@keyframes pulse{0%,100%{outline-color:var(--acc)}50%{outline-color:transparent}}
@keyframes shake{0%,100%{transform:translateX(0)}25%{transform:translateX(-4px)}75%{transform:translateX(4px)}}
.legend{display:flex; gap:14px; justify-content:center; font-size:12px; color:var(--mut); margin-top:10px; flex-wrap:wrap}
.legend i{display:inline-block; width:10px; height:10px; border-radius:3px; margin-right:4px; vertical-align:-1px}
.legend .li{background:var(--ci)} .legend .lm{background:var(--cm)}
.legend .lf{background:var(--cf)} .legend .lt{background:var(--ct)}
.kbd-caption{text-align:center; font-size:12.5px; color:var(--mut); margin:10px 0 12px}
.imewarn{
  text-align:center; font-size:13px; color:#92400e; background:#fef3c7;
  border:1px solid #fde68a; border-radius:10px; padding:8px 10px; margin-bottom:14px;
}
.imewarn.urgent{background:#fee2e2; border-color:#fca5a5; color:#b91c1c; font-weight:700}

/* ========== 撠銵?========== */
.colsec{margin-bottom:22px}
.colhead{display:flex; align-items:baseline; gap:10px; flex-wrap:wrap; margin-bottom:8px}
.colhead h3{margin:0; font-size:16.5px}
.colhead .ckeys{font-size:12.5px; color:var(--acc); font-weight:700}
.colhead .ccat{font-size:12px; color:var(--mut)}
.cards{display:flex; gap:10px; flex-wrap:wrap}
.card{
  width:150px; background:#fff; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:14px;
  padding:12px 10px 10px; text-align:center; cursor:pointer; position:relative;
  transition:transform .12s, box-shadow .12s;
}
.card:hover{transform:translateY(-3px); box-shadow:0 8px 18px rgba(40,40,60,.10)}
.card.pulse{animation:cardpulse .45s}
@keyframes cardpulse{0%{box-shadow:0 0 0 0 rgba(79,86,232,.45)}100%{box-shadow:0 0 0 14px rgba(79,86,232,0)}}
.card .cz{font-size:34px; font-weight:900; line-height:1.15}
.card .cp{font-size:15px; font-weight:700; margin:2px 0 6px}
.card .ck{font-size:12px}
.card .cex{font-size:11.5px; color:var(--mut); margin-top:7px; border-top:1px dashed var(--line); padding-top:6px}
.card .cex:hover{color:var(--acc)}
.card.cat-i .cp{color:var(--ci)} .card.cat-m .cp{color:var(--cm)}
.card.cat-f .cp{color:var(--cf)} .card.cat-t .cp{color:var(--ct)}
.card .spk{position:absolute; top:8px; right:9px; font-size:12px; opacity:.4}
.tips{background:#f6f7ff; border:1px solid #e0e3ff; border-radius:14px; padding:16px 20px}
.tips h3{margin:0 0 10px; font-size:16px}
.tips ol{margin:0; padding-left:22px; font-size:14px}
.tips li{margin-bottom:9px}
.tips b{color:var(--acc)}

/* ========== ??蝺渡? ========== */
.tg{background:#f8f7f3; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:14px; padding:14px 16px; margin-bottom:14px; text-align:center}
.tg.done{background:#ecfdf5; border-color:#a7f3d0}
.tg-label{font-size:12px; color:var(--mut); letter-spacing:2px}
.tg-word{font-size:34px; font-weight:900; letter-spacing:6px; cursor:pointer}
.tg-word:hover{color:var(--acc)}
.tg-syls{display:flex; justify-content:center; gap:16px; margin:8px 0 10px; flex-wrap:wrap}
.hsyl{display:inline-flex; gap:5px; padding:6px 10px; border-radius:10px; background:#fff; border:1px solid var(--line)}
.hsyl.ok{background:#d1fae5; border-color:#6ee7b7}
.hz{display:inline-flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; gap:3px; font-size:19px; font-weight:700}
.hz kbd{font-size:10px}
.hz.ht{color:var(--ct)}
.tg-btns{display:flex; gap:8px; justify-content:center; flex-wrap:wrap}
.tg-btns button{
  border:1px solid var(--line); background:#fff; border-radius:9px;
  padding:6px 13px; font-family:inherit; font-size:13px; cursor:pointer;
}
.tg-btns button:hover{border-color:var(--acc); color:var(--acc)}
.line{
  min-height:86px; background:#fff; border:2px solid var(--line); border-radius:14px;
  padding:12px; display:flex; gap:10px; align-items:center; overflow-x:auto; margin-bottom:12px;
}
.line.shake{animation:shake .3s}
.line-empty{color:var(--mut); font-size:14px; padding:6px 8px}
.syl{
  flex:none; text-align:center; background:#f2f4ff; border:1px solid #dde2ff;
  border-radius:10px; padding:7px 12px; animation:pop .18s;
}
.syl .sz{font-size:23px; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:1px}
.syl .sp{font-size:12.5px; color:var(--acc); margin-top:2px}
.syl.building{background:#fffbeb; border:1px dashed #f5cf6b}
.syl.building .sp{color:#b58a1f}
@keyframes pop{0%{transform:scale(.7); opacity:0}100%{transform:scale(1); opacity:1}}
.line-tools{display:flex; gap:8px; justify-content:center; flex-wrap:wrap; margin-bottom:12px}
.line-tools .iconbtn{font-size:13.5px}

/* ========== ?萎?皜祇? ========== */
.drill-bar{display:flex; gap:10px; align-items:center; flex-wrap:wrap; margin-bottom:10px}
.drill-bar label{font-size:13.5px; color:#555; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:5px}
.drill-bar select{padding:7px 10px; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:9px; background:#fff; font-family:inherit; font-size:13.5px}
.drill-stats{font-size:13.5px; color:var(--mut); margin-bottom:6px}
.drill-stats b{color:var(--ink); font-size:15px}
.dprompt{
  min-height:150px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
  gap:6px; background:#f8f7f3; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:14px; margin-bottom:14px;
}
.dprompt.shake{animation:shake .3s}
.dbig{font-size:78px; font-weight:900; line-height:1.1}
.dsub{font-size:13px; color:var(--mut)}
.dplay{border:none; background:var(--acc); color:#fff; font-size:34px; width:84px; height:84px; border-radius:50%; cursor:pointer; box-shadow:0 6px 16px rgba(79,86,232,.35)}
.dplay:active{transform:scale(.95)}

/* ========== ?內瘚桀惜 ========== */
#toast{
  position:fixed; left:50%; bottom:34px; transform:translateX(-50%) translateY(20px);
  background:#26282f; color:#fff; font-size:14.5px; padding:11px 20px; border-radius:12px;
  opacity:0; pointer-events:none; transition:all .25s; z-index:99; max-width:90vw; text-align:center;
}
#toast.show{opacity:1; transform:translateX(-50%) translateY(0)}

footer{width:min(1080px,96vw); margin:0 auto 40px; font-size:12.5px; color:var(--mut); text-align:center}
.mobile-only{display:none}

/* ========== 撟單 ========== */
@media (max-width:920px){
  :root{--kw:46px; --kh:48px}
  .key .kz{font-size:17px}
  .dbig{font-size:60px}
  .card{width:128px}
}

/* ========== ??嚗??拚?嚗?支?頞?Ｗ? ========== */
@media (max-width:720px){
  :root{
    --kb-gap:3px;
    --kb-pad:6px;
    /* ?銝? 12 憿嚗??Ｗ?撖砍漲?芸?蝮格嚗?椰?單?銝 */
    --kw:calc((100vw - 28px - 2 * var(--kb-pad) - 11 * var(--kb-gap)) / 12);
    --kh:max(44px, calc(var(--kw) * 1.25));
  }
  body{padding-bottom:24px; overflow-x:hidden}
  main,header,.tabs,footer{
    width:100%;
    max-width:100%;
    padding-left:10px;
    padding-right:10px;
    box-sizing:border-box;
  }
  header{margin:10px auto 6px; gap:10px}
  header h1{font-size:18px}
  header .sub{font-size:12px}
  .logo{width:46px; height:46px; border-radius:12px}
  .hcontrols{width:100%; margin-left:0}
  .hcontrols select{max-width:none; flex:1; min-width:0}
  .tabs{margin:6px auto 12px; gap:4px; padding:4px}
  .tabs button{font-size:12.5px; padding:10px 2px; line-height:1.2}
  .panel{padding:12px; border-radius:14px; margin-bottom:12px}
  .desc,.kbd-caption{font-size:12px}
  .mobile-only{display:block}
  .desktop-only{display:none !important}

  /* ?萇嚗?瘨??Ｙ??航蝮格?嚗蝵桐葉?芣遛 */
  .kbwrap{overflow:visible; padding:0; width:100%}
  .keyboard{
    width:100%; max-width:100%; margin:0;
    padding:var(--kb-pad); border-radius:12px;
    box-sizing:border-box;
  }
  .krow{
    gap:var(--kb-gap);
    margin-bottom:var(--kb-gap);
    margin-left:0 !important;
    justify-content:center;
  }
  .key{
    border-radius:8px;
    touch-action:manipulation;
    min-width:0;
  }
  .key .kq{font-size:7px; top:1px; left:2px}
  .key .kz{font-size:clamp(12px, 3.6vw, 16px); font-weight:800}
  .key .kp{display:none}
  .key.space{width:min(calc(100% - 8px), calc(var(--kw) * 9)); max-width:100%}
  .key.space .kz{font-size:12px; white-space:nowrap}

  .card{width:calc(50% - 6px); padding:10px 6px}
  .card .cz{font-size:28px}
  .card .cp{font-size:13px}
  .card .cex{font-size:10.5px}
  .colhead h3{font-size:15px}
  .tips{padding:12px 14px}
  .tips ol{font-size:13px; padding-left:18px}

  .tg{padding:12px}
  .tg-word{font-size:26px; letter-spacing:3px}
  .tg-syls{gap:8px}
  .hsyl{padding:5px 7px}
  .hz{font-size:16px}
  .tg-btns button,.line-tools .iconbtn,.iconbtn{
    min-height:40px; padding:8px 12px; font-size:13px;
    touch-action:manipulation;
  }
  .tg-praise{font-size:15px; padding:8px 10px}
  .line{min-height:70px; padding:8px; margin-bottom:10px}
  .syl .sz{font-size:18px}
  .drill-bar{gap:8px}
  .drill-bar label{width:100%; justify-content:space-between}
  .drill-bar select{flex:1; min-height:40px}
  .dbig{font-size:52px}
  .dprompt{min-height:120px}
  .dplay{width:72px; height:72px; font-size:28px}
  #toast{bottom:18px; font-size:14px; padding:12px 16px}
  footer{font-size:11.5px; margin-bottom:24px}
}

@media (max-width:380px){
  :root{
    --kb-gap:2px;
    --kw:calc((100vw - 20px - 2 * var(--kb-pad) - 11 * var(--kb-gap)) / 12);
    --kh:max(40px, calc(var(--kw) * 1.2));
  }
  .tabs button{font-size:11.5px}
  .key .kz{font-size:clamp(11px, 3.4vw, 14px)}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <div class="logo">????/div>
  <div>
    <h1>瘜券?萇?恕</h1>
    <div class="sub">蝯行?喃蝙?刻?瘜券???仿??駁??撠望??潮</div>
  </div>
  <div class="hcontrols">
    <span id="voiceWarn">?曆??唬葉???喉?撱箄降??Edge ??Chrome ??</span>
    <button class="iconbtn" id="soundBtn" title="?單???">?? ?單???/button>
    <select id="voiceSel" title="?豢??潮隤"></select>
  </div>
</header>

<nav class="tabs">
  <button data-tab="chart" class="on">???潮撠銵?/button>
  <button data-tab="type">????蝺渡?</button>
  <button data-tab="drill">???萎?皜祇?</button>
</nav>

<main>

  <!-- ========== ??銝嚗??扯” ========== -->
  <section id="tab-chart" class="show">
    <div class="panel">
      <h2>?游?日?見</h2>
      <p class="desc">暺撟?????湔?脖??祕擃?歹??賣??潮?釣?喲?斗???渲?銝?渲??????撌阡? <kbd>1</kbd><kbd>Q</kbd><kbd>A</kbd><kbd>Z</kbd> ?曹??唬?撠望 ??????/p>
      <p class="desc mobile-only">??銝?撌血??暺?嚗雿??刻撟?葬撠?銝?撌血????/p>
      <div class="kbwrap"><div id="kb-chart"></div></div>
      <div class="legend">
        <span><i class="li"></i>?脫?嚗?1嚗?/span><span><i class="lm"></i>隞嚗?嚗?/span>
        <span><i class="lf"></i>?餅?嚗?3嚗?/span><span><i class="lt"></i>?脰矽嚗?嚗?/span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="panel">
      <h2>?潮 ??瘜券 撠??/h2>
      <p class="desc">瘥撐?∠?嚗釣?喟泵????喋?支?蝵柴?摮??∠??賜泵??喉?暺?摮?游???/p>
      <div id="chartCols"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="panel tips">
      <h3>?潮雿輻??摰寞??∩???8 隞嗡?</h3>
      <ol>
